. This allows your ship to access areas your team can't.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653740/extras/6632da0da0459501e38a9fa78adfdda2.poster.avif?t=1729196573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653740/extras/6632da0da0459501e38a9fa78adfdda2.webm?t=1729196573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653740/extras/6632da0da0459501e38a9fa78adfdda2.mp4?t=1729196573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
